# .gitignore for the NL2FRET repository
# Principle: final results (jsonl files, judgment results, reports, MANIFEST and FROZEN*.sha256 files) are tracked,
# except those under experiments/, which is excluded as a whole (see the end of this file).

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Virtual environments (experiments/nl2fret/.venv is 1.2 GB and contains hard-coded absolute paths, so it is not tracked)
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Operating system and editor files
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*secret*
*credentials*

# Temporary working directories (FRET check work files, 812 generated NuSMV .smv inputs, etc.)
work/
tmp/
.mock_state/
results_mock/
UNVERIFIED.md

# Archives (input and result zips; the result folders also exist unpacked)
*.zip

# LaTeX build artifacts (generic; docs/paper/ is already excluded as a whole below)
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz

# Docker cache
.docker/

# Exclusions decided by the project owner (2026-11-08): local instructions, experiment records, and the paper in progress
testnote.md
experiments/
docs/paper/

# ---- Open items (whether to track them is for the project owner to decide) ----
# 1. Large result folders: experiments/nl7/results_lm (about 67 MB), experiments/nl3/results_nl3 (about 36 MB), etc.
#    They are tracked at present. If size becomes a problem, uncomment the next line to exclude only large raw
#    outputs such as calls.jsonl.
# experiments/**/calls.jsonl
# 2. The 11 paper PDFs (experiments/nl2fret/pdfs, about 25 MB) are covered by the experiments/ exclusion. The paper in
#    progress (docs/paper/) is excluded as a whole.
# 3. Run logs (run.log, console.log, *_console.log) are run records and are kept tracked.
# 4. Because *.zip is excluded, the original input archives (inputs/*.zip) are not in git. Store them elsewhere
#    if they must be preserved.
# 5. Because experiments/ is excluded as a whole, items 1 to 3 above (tracking of results inside the experiment
#    folders) do not currently apply.
